[0.029, "o", "\r\n\r\n"]
[36.525, "o", "Test my Agentforce agent: connect to sfagent-dev, list the agents, start a session with Agentforce_Service_Agent, send 'Can you help me with my order?', then end the session and show me the response.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "I’ll run the Agentforce preview flow against `sfagent-dev`: list available agents, open `Agentforce_Service_Agent`, send the order-help prompt, then close the session.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mlist_agents started\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mlist_agents (completed)\u001b[0m\r\n`sfagent-dev` has one available agent, `Agentforce_Service_Agent`, so I’m starting a headless session with that agent now.\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mstart_session started\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mstart_session (completed)\u001b[0m\r\nThe session is active. I’m sending the exact prompt: `Can you help me with my order?`\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1msend_message started\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1msend_message (completed)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "The agent responded with an identity verification request. I’m ending the session now so the preview run is closed cleanly.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mend_session started\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mend_session (completed)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "Test completed against `sfagent-dev`.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "Listed agents:\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "`Agentforce_Service_Agent` - Agentforce Service Agent\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "Agent response to `Can you help me with my order?`:\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "> Sure! Before we proceed, I need to verify your identity for security purposes. Could you please provide your email address or username?\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\nSession ended cleanly: `019e5a84-1cf6-7c96-a8d6-26a84135f12a`.\r\n11,377\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "Test completed against `sfagent-dev`.\r\n\r\nListed agents:\r\n`Agentforce_Service_Agent` - Agentforce Service Agent\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "Agent response to `Can you help me with my order?`:\r\n\r\n> Sure! Before we proceed, I need to verify your identity for security purposes. Could you please provide your email address or username?\r\n"]
